title: "ACBench: Auditing Feedback Scaffolds in LLM Performance Engineering"
abstract: >-
  ACBench is a benchmark and analysis suite for auditing retry and profiling
  feedback scaffolds in live-measured LLM performance-engineering loops over
  retained real-PR Go optimization scenarios.
